--- task
id: t05
dataset: section8
kind: membership in a list property

--- intent
List the titles of documents tagged "rust".

--- edition2
query tagged() {
  match { $d: Doc  $d.tags contains "rust" }
  return { $d.title }
}

--- edition3
query tagged() {
  match { $d: Doc  "rust" in $d.tags }
  return { $d.title }
}

--- expect unordered
columns: ["d.title"]
["The graph primer"]
["Rust in production"]
["The search engine"]
